      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9070986682265164292, guid: 5544226b037396441bbf3325159d66b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\tI worked the first full shift. It was TERRIBLE. All this raw, slimy
        meat... ugh. My heartrate was rising and at some point I think I started
        hallucinating.\n\r\n\tI saw... something. Something big. Something that definetly
        shouldn't be there. I ran immediatelly, hid in my room and shut the door.
        I got all sweaty and My heart was beating like crazy...\n\r\n\tInside the
        locker, I found a pack of cigarettes. I quit long time ago, but... maybe
        it'll help me relax. Or maybe I'll just spend my time with the cacti. I definetly
        have to find some way to keep my cool."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
